{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_home_work

    «Your work» on the app's home (local\yourwork), for whoever runs something: under its heading, the first things
    waiting to be sorted out, the urgent first, and a door into each service, two in a row. Its «See all» opens the whole
    panel, only when that has more: more things waiting, or the services' shortcuts.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * work - heading, seeall, hasmore, hasshown, shown (mobile_work_alert), doors (mobile_work_door) and short (true: the
      doors' lines in whole parts); none when the person runs nothing.

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
{{#work}}
<div class="aty-seccion-cab">
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{heading}}</h2>
    {{#hasmore}}<button type="button" class="aty-ver" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_work" title="{{heading}}" [args]="{}">{{seeall}}</button>{{/hasmore}}
</div>
{{#hasshown}}
<div class="aty-agenda">
    {{#shown}}
    {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_work_alert }}
    {{/shown}}
</div>
{{/hasshown}}
<div class="aty-puertas">
    {{#doors}}
    {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_work_door }}
    {{/doors}}
</div>
{{/work}}
